# Hermes kanban task worktrees. Each is a full copy of this repo; Dockerfile
# line 56 is `COPY . .`, so without these the build context (and every layer
# built from it) carries ~100 duplicate checkouts. This inflated the image
# from ~6GB to 17.4GB.
.worktrees
.minio-nas-integration-*

# Local build/report artifacts and backups that must never reach an image.
report
*.bundle
**/backups
deploy*/secrets
